      en: (p2) => `Untagged PDF document (PDF ${p2.version}) \u2014 ${p2.marked === "yes" ? "/MarkInfo declares it marked" : "no /MarkInfo << /Marked true >>"}, ${p2.structTree === "yes" ? "a structure tree exists" : "no structure tree (/StructTreeRoot)"}: assistive technology reads a flat stream of text with no headings, lists or tables.`
